coth0201	Kevin: You know, this was a real boundary-pushing, from an adventure game genre point of view. And I was making the joke earlier that it's like if everyone isn't claiming that you're ruining adventure games, you're not making adventure an adventure game because...
coth0202	Bret: The grand heritage has to be insulted by every new-- Every new thing you do in adventure games has to be an insult to all adventure games before it. "How dare you innovate!"
