coth0303	Tim: So if you wanna put the bone in the bone grinder, you have to put them in this receptacle in the room. Another weird mechanical contrivance from my own head: a handheld snow grinder that would plug into a giant snow grinder. I'm sure they have those, right?
coth0304	Peter M: What's a snow grinder?
coth0305	Tim: It's like a fake, like, to make fake snow for the show. And this is what I was talking about, you can't use the hand with the snow grinder.
